    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Pact Blade. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft.\n\nHit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage.\n\nSpellcasting. The cultist casts one of the following spells, using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12, +4 to hit with spell attacks):\n\nAt Will: Light, Thaumaturgy\n\n2/Day: Command\n\n1/Day: Hold Person"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bonus Actions",
      "rulesText": "Spiritual Weapon (2/Day). The cultist casts the Spiritual Weapon spell, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting."
    }
